00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.640
Still looking forward to season two and three though.

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:02.340
Sword Art Online has gotten to the point where I just genuinely enjoy it for what it is.

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:07.040
This is just fun popcorn entertainment and exactly why I enjoy isekai in the first place,

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:09.960
though I do find it funny that all my favorite parts of Sword Art Online

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:12.900
have conveniently come when Kirito is out of the picture.

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:15.260
Alice taking on the main role has been a welcome change

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:18.640
and there have been criticism that she's just a ripoff from Saber from Fate,

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:20.120
but come on guys.

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:21.860
I mean she may look like Saber,

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:22.940
talk like Saber,

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:24.060
act like Saber,

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:25.140
fight like Saber,

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:27.320
have very similar looking powers as Saber,

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:29.000
but she's also..

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:30.280
a tsundere.

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:32.580
So I don't see how she can be a ripoff

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:34.020
(when she's quite clearly an upgrade).

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.640
Kenja no Mago was an isekai.

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:38.320
That's pretty much all I remember despite actually finishing it.

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:42.160
Of course isekai's still isekai and there was plenty of trash which I'll get back to later,

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:47.760
but for me, the surprise of the year was Isekai Quartet, 'cause I enjoyed it way more than I anticipated.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.580
I thought I would get bored after two episodes,

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:52.910
but the character writing and banter was so on point that it never got old.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:57.000
We've gotten to the point where we can just put a bunch of isekai characters in an isekai world

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.340
and have them talk about isekai stuff and it's just entertaining.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:04.220
This is partly because it just kind of felt like an episode of KonoSuba with an extended cast,

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.200
which is probably why I enjoyed it so much.

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:09.840
And I'm just glad that we finally have our own
Avenger-kai's.

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:14.660
They may not be able to avenge the world, but you can be damn sure they'll reincarnate into another one.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:19.780
Overall I think the moral of this year is that isekai is here to stay and is still definitely thriving,

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:22.340
and that's fine because you know what?

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:22.940
*Takes a breath*

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:24.880
